      "cardText": "The Ringmaster cracks the whip at the clock and sells tickets to the delay; everyone pays twice."
    },
    {
      "cardNumber": 2,
      "beats": [
        4
      ],
      "cardText": "The Paper Elephant looks enormous on the poster, folds flat when it rains; the crowd applauds."
    },
    {
      "cardNumber": 3,
      "beats": [
        6
      ],
      "cardText": "The Brass Accountant counts the trumpets, never the tunes; every note audited, nothing heard."
    },
    {
